# Smarthub v2 — Project Context

## Status (2026-09-06)
- Forum: nested komentar (parent_komentar_id + foto_url di forum_komentar, model/repo/handler selesai) + kompresi gambar upload (JPEG q80 / PNG BestCompression, max lebar 1200px). Migration `backend/migrations/add_forum_parent_komentar.sql` BELUM dijalankan; binary belum di-build/deploy.

## Status (2026-09-05)
Fase 0-7 + UI/UX layer restructure + bento grid dashboard (10 heuristik UX) SELESAI. Live: https://smarthub.logikraf.id
Repo: github.com/nvnrchmn/smarthub-v2 (branch main). DB: smarthub_v2 (MySQL), port 8082.

## Tech Stack
- Backend: Go 1.25 + Fiber v3 + GORM + MySQL (root di env, jangan disimpan di config) + Redis + JWT (HS256) + AES-256-GCM
- Frontend: React 18 + Vite + react-router + Tailwind v4 + Plus Jakarta Sans; dark/light theme, warna primary #1B6B4A (hijau toska)
- Deploy: VPS 103.197.188.248 aaPanel; service systemd `smarthub-server` di /usr/local/bin; frontend rsync ke /www/wwwroot/smarthub.logikraf.id; nginx SPA fallback + proxy_pass 127.0.0.1:8082/ (strip /api)
- CI/CD: commit + push GitHub → deploy manual scp/rsync (belum ada GitHub Actions)

## Arsitektur
- Multi-tenancy: roles `super_admin` (panel /admin), `ketua_rt` (panel /rt), `warga` (app mobile /app), Public (/)
- Clean architecture per modul: internal/{auth,wilayah,warga,keuangan,forum,lapak,admin}/{repository,service,handler}.go
- Model GORM wajib `TableName()` eksplisit (tabel non-plural: rumah, warga) — DetailTagihan sudah punya
- Route API TANPA prefix /api di router Fiber (nginx yang strip); `/admin/*` khusus super_admin
- Middleware auth.go: `resolve()` validasi token + set locals (TANPA c.Next()) — dipakai AuthRequired & RoleRequired. JANGAN panggil AuthRequired dari middleware lain (double-Next → panic). resolve mengembalikan error sentinel; 401 ditulis oleh AuthRequired/RoleRequired (jangan `return c.Status(401).JSON(...)` di resolve — nil-err → auth bypass, bug f6c66ee)
- RBAC (audit f6c66ee): mutasi warga/wilayah/rumah + generate tagihan → `RoleRequired("ketua_rt","super_admin")`; GET semua role ter-auth; DELETE lapak hanya pemilik/ketua/super; register publik = role warga saja
- Tenant scope: SELALU dari JWT `c.Locals("tenant_id")` — jangan pernah percaya `?tenant_id=` query atau body (cross-tenant leak, ditutup di f6c66ee)
- DB: skema via deployments/mysql/*.sql (DDL+seed), BUKAN AutoMigrate (dulu Error 3780 int/bigint tiap boot)
- DB: 10 tabel inti + forum_threads/forum_komentar/lapak_warga; seed 2 tenant, 6 user

## Docs acuan (baca dulu sebelum kerja)
docs/{PRD,Architecture,Design(arsip),DESIGN-SYSTEM,UX-HEURISTICS,DDL,task}.md di root repo

## Layout Pattern (FIX 2026-09-05)
- Semua layout: `h-dvh flex flex-col bg-surface` — TIDAK BOLEH pakai `min-h-screen` + scroll seluruh body
- `<main className="flex-1 overflow-y-auto overflow-x-hidden">` — hanya konten yang scroll
- BottomNav/BottomBar: fixed di bawah via `flex-shrink-0` (bukan `fixed` + `bottom-0` + `pb-28`)
- Modal/Drawer: render via `createPortal(..., document.body)` — centered viewport, independen dari scroll user
- Struktur: `<h-dvh><aside fixed/><main flex-1 overflow-y-auto><Outlet/></main><BottomNav/></h-dvh>` + `<Portal><Modal/></Portal>`

## Konvensi
- UI bahasa Indonesia; touch target >= 44px; input text-base (cegah iOS zoom); kontras AA; mode gelap otomatis via prefers-color-scheme (token warna = CSS var di index.css)
- LoginPage (2026-09-06): redesign premium SaaS — kartu rounded-2xl center di h-dvh, input h-12 rounded-xl text-base + ikon kiri, tombol utama h-12, latar blur blob + dot grid dekoratif. LOGIC identik: login via nomor WA + password (tanpa Google OAuth), redirect per role. Public layout tetap pakai h-dvh (bukan min-h-screen).
- Komponen UI: pakai `components/ui/bento.tsx` (BentoCard/KPI/ActionTile/Skeleton/EmptyState/ErrorState) & `Icon.tsx` (SVG, JANGAN emoji) — lihat docs/UX-HEURISTICS.md (10 heuristik Nielsen & psikologi UX, e3dc1f5)
- Register publik = warga + auto-login (token langsung) + profil warga dibuat atomik (tx) — jangan CreateUser terpisah
- Tema: auto (OS) default; toggle dark/light menyimpan 'sh-theme' (light/dark) di localStorage & set data-theme di <html>; motion pakai class .page-enter/.sheet-panel/bg-shimmer (index.css) — hormati prefers-reduced-motion
- Endpoint keuangan: POST /tagihan/generate (massal) & /tagihan/generate-rumah {id_rumah,periode} (manual, idempoten, RBAC pengurus) — 7b1fc9c
- Frontend: helper `api(path)` di src/lib/api.ts SUDAH prepend BASE '/api' — panggil `api('/forum')`, JANGAN `api('/api/forum')` (double-prefix → 404/500, bug 2b19e86)
- Backup cron VPS: 03:00 → /www/backup/smarthub

## Deployment (FIX 2026-09-05)
- Build lokal: `cd frontend && npm run build` → `frontend/dist/`
- Sync ke VPS: `sudo cp -r frontend/dist/* /www/wwwroot/smarthub.logikraf.id/ && sudo chown -R www:www /www/wwwroot/smarthub.logikraf.id/`
- Restart: `sudo nginx -s reload` + `sudo systemctl restart smarthub` (atau kill + nohup)
- File lama di web root harus dihapus sebelum copy baru (nama file hash berubah tiap build)
- Service: `/usr/local/bin/smarthub-server` (systemd), port 8082, config `/etc/smarthub.env`

## Features (2026-09-05 - sesi 4)

### Settlement (Tagihan QRIS)
- Alur: Warga bayar via QRIS → status PAID → Ketua RT request settlement → Super Admin approve/reject
- Backend: `internal/settlement/` (service + handler), tabel `settlement_requests`, `settlement_tagihan`
- Frontend: RT (`/rt/settlement`), Admin (`/admin/settlement`)
- Xendit API: `TransferToBank` siap pakai (butuh `XENDIT_SECRET_KEY` & `XENDIT_DISBURSEMENT_ID` di env)
- Endpoint: GET `/settlement/balance`, POST `/settlement/request`, GET `/settlements`, GET/POST `/admin/settlements/*`

### Subscription Per-Rumah (Rp 3.000/rumah/bulan)
- Model: 1 rumah = 1 langganan (bukan per-tenant)
- Tabel: `layanan`, `invoice`
- Backend: `internal/subscription/` (service + handler)
- Frontend: RT (`/rt/langganan`), Admin (`/admin/subscription`)
- Fitur lengkap otomatis aktif untuk rumah berlangganan
- Endpoint: GET `/subscription/layanan`, POST `/subscription/request`, GET `/subscription/invoices`, GET `/admin/subscription/*`

### CMS Landing Page
- Semua section editable: Hero, Features, Pricing, FAQ, Testimonials, Footer
- Backend: `internal/cms/` (service + handler), tabel `cms_landing` (JSON)
- Frontend: Admin (`/admin/cms`) dengan rich text editor
- Endpoint: GET `/cms/landing` (public), PUT `/admin/cms/:section` (super_admin)

### Super Admin Features
- Tenant Detail: `/admin/tenants/:id` (statistik lengkap tenant)
- Analytics Dashboard: `/admin/analytics` (grafik revenue, pertumbuhan)
- Audit Logs: `/admin/audit-logs` (tracking aktivitas user)
- Broadcast: `/admin/broadcast` (kirim pengumuman ke user)
- Audit Log juga dicatat otomatis di `audit_log` tabel

### Notifikasi & KYC
- In-app notification: `internal/notifikasi/` (service + handler), tabel `notifikasi`
- WhatsApp notification: `SendWhatsApp` service (butuh WA Business API)
- Upload KTP: `/notifikasi/upload-ktp` (KYC)
- Frontend: `NotificationBell` component (auto-refresh 30 detik, badge unread)

### Xendit Settings via Admin Panel
- Super Admin bisa save `xendit_secret_key` & `xendit_webhook_token` di `/admin/settings`
- Data disimpan terenkripsi AES-GCM di tabel `settings`
- Endpoint: GET `/admin/settings` (status), POST `/admin/settings` (save)

### Bottom Nav Pattern
- Maksimal 4 menu + tombol "Lainnya" (drawer untuk menu tambahan)
- Warga: Beranda, Tagihan, Forum, Lapak, Lainnya → Pengaturan
- RT: Dashboard, Warga, Tagihan, Settlement, Lainnya → Langganan + Pengaturan
- Admin: Dashboard, Tenants, Settlement, Subscription, Lainnya → CMS + Audit + Broadcast + Users + Pengaturan

## 📋 AUDIT SaaS 2026-09-05 (lihat /tmp/audit_backend.md + /tmp/audit_frontend.md)
- ✅ FIXED 2026-09-05: JWT_SECRET di-rotate (64 hex random, env file 600) + jwt.go fail-fast tanpa fallback; token lama invalid (semua user logout). RBAC invite whitelist (ketua_rt→warga saja; super_admin→warga/ketua_rt; warga dilarang) + guard kode legacy di register-invite. PasswordHash kini json:"-". Terverifikasi E2E.
- ✅ FIXED P1 2026-09-05: middleware auth kini cek DB per request — user dihapus/diblokir (rejected/banned/suspend/nonaktif) → 401; ROLE dari DB bukan klaim (forge role mati, terverifikasi). Rate limit per IP asli via TrustProxy + ProxyHeader X-Real-IP (nginx overwrite, anti-spoof; terverifikasi 429 di 101). ErrorHandler hormati kode Fiber: unknown route → 404 (sebelumnya 500), error ≥500 generik + log server. Recover middleware ditambah. Webhook Xendit validasi nominal (amount vs total_nominal). Seed super_admin id_user=1 di-set user_status=active (sebelumnya pending_verifikasi). Super admin lain di DB: TIDAK ADA (aman).
- ✅ FIXED P2 2026-09-05: tenant_id kini dari DB (klaim basi user pindah RT mati; terverifikasi klaim 999→DB 1). User `suspended`/`rejected`/`banned`/`nonaktif` diblokir 401 (terverifikasi user 20). Password policy min 8 karakter (backend 3 titik + frontend GabungRTPage/RegisterPage/RegisterPengurusPage) + bcrypt cost 12.
- ✅ FIXED P2b 2026-09-05 (info-only, pilihan Nova): login/register kini mengembalikan `tenant_status`; UI AppLayout tampilkan banner amber jika status ≠ AKTIF (tanpa blokir). Terverifikasi E2E (registrasi → tenant_status=AKTIF).
- 🚨 CRITICAL: eskalasi warga→super_admin via POST /auth/invite-codes (main.go:87 cuma AuthRequired; role_for tanpa whitelist service.go:267-284; register-invite pakai role dari kode service.go:232; token terbit walau status pending_verifikasi — middleware auth tak cek status).
- 🚨 CRITICAL: bcrypt hash bocor via GET /admin/users (model.User tanpa json tag → c.JSON(users) serialize PasswordHash).
- HIGH: rate limiter 100/min in-memory tanpa TrustProxy → semua user 1 bucket 127.0.0.1; unknown route → 500 (ErrorHandler main.go:59-61 override); build rusak: blacklist.go panggil parseBearer undefined; password min 6 karakter; uang pakai float64; webhook mark PAID tanpa cek nominal; admin ListUsers ambil semua kolom.
- HIGH frontend: JWT+profil di localStorage (tanpa httpOnly/refresh); GabungRTPage simpan token di kunci 'access_token' ≠ 'token' yang dibaca api.ts; tanpa handling 401/redirect; tanpa timeout/abort.
- TINDAKAN SEGERA: rotate JWT_SECRET + tambah validasi role_for invite + json:"-" di PasswordHash + bereskan parseBearer.

## UI/UX REDESIGN (2026-09-06)
- **Full redesign** tampilan SaaS profesional (Linear/Stripe/Vercel style)
- **CSS tokens**: Primary #0E764A (crisper emerald), refined neutrals, improved dark mode contrast
- **File yang di-redesign**: index.css, LandingPage.tsx, Dashboard.tsx (admin/rt/warga), AdminLayout.tsx, bento.tsx, LoginPage.tsx
- **bento.tsx**: 9 komponen diperbarui (BentoCard, KPI, ActionTile, SectionHead, Progress, Avatar, Skeleton, EmptyState, ErrorState) — API tetap sama
- **AdminLayout**: Sidebar w-64, logo gradient "SH", nav sections (Keuangan/Konten/Sistem), active pill + left accent bar
- **Landing Page**: Sticky glass navbar, hero gradient + floating orbs, feature cards, social proof, price card
- **Admin Dashboard**: Premium welcome banner, KPI conic-gradient ring, MiniStat cards
- **RT Dashboard**: Hero iuran card, compliance card, pending approvals dengan accent bar
- **Warga Dashboard**: Status card, greeting header, token-aware status tints
- **Login Page**: Glass card, decorative backdrop blur, refined inputs
- **Backend**: Tidak ada perubahan API — semua logic identik
- **Dark mode compatible**: Semua token-aware, tidak ada hardcoded colors
